            "review_title": "Review at Grillin's & Chillin's on Wheels",
            "review_text": "Мария И\nKorolev, Russia4 contributions\n1\nI want to come back here again and again.\nMar 2024 • Friends\nThis is the most delicious food in Nha Trang. That case when you want to lick your fingers, your plate... A gastronomic orgasm is inevitable. Nice atmosphere, the owners, who are also the chefs, are simply wonderful. By the way, the owner had his own restaurant in Barcelona with a Michelin star.\nOpen from Mon to Sat. From 17.30. You need to book your place through zalo or Instagram.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten March 26, 2024",
