            "review_title": "Review at Grillin's & Chillin's on Wheels",
            "review_text": "Александр К\nNizhny Novgorod, Russia3 contributions\n1\nFinding good service and cuisine in Nha Trang.\nMar 2024 • Couples\nOne of the best places visited in Nha Trang. It looks like a small “restaurant on wheels” (hello and a reference to the movie “Chef on Wheels”), chairs around, a menu that is updated daily. Be sure to book! Why? Guys, there's really a queue here! Tasty, atmospheric, music and excellent service. Is it worth a special visit here? Costs! The chef is a Michelin star holder who is a virtuoso in everything. A special recommendation is the shrimp ceviche - eat it and cry with happiness.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten March 11, 2024",
