            "review_title": "Review at Grillin's & Chillin's on Wheels",
            "review_text": "Emma\nMordialloc, Australia2 contributions\n2\nHidden gem in Nha Trang\nJan 2024 • Couples\nWe came across this food van by accident when looking for a spot to eat in Nha Trang. A happy accident! The Spanish tapas were incredibly tasty, cooked fresh right in front of us. We also enjoyed some lovely wine to go with it, while we chatted with the chef about where they source their ingredients, which are fresh from the market everyday. The chefs are so talented and their service really made our experience special. Definitely worth checking this out if you are in Nha Trang!\nRead more\nWritten January 31, 2024",
