            "review_text": "Bangle@gmail.com\nPhu Quoc Island, Vietnam40 contributions\n2\nI have 1 trip to Nha Trang, and I walk around the streets for fresh under the apartments. Then see the truck food so nice. Come\nJan 2024 • Friends\nBeautfull Bar and tapas menu in truck, fuison, and Spanish culture food. It has amazing testing and wines by glass or bottle with a short list. Seafood paella, BBQ fish of the day, chili garlic prawns, baby shrimps pan fried with \"all I oli\" sauce. Clams and mussels in surf and turf sauce ...👌 😎 wow , and the chef menu will change any time when he sees produce fresh in the market by day.\nRead more\nWritten January 7, 2024",
